# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `wrangler dev`. `.dev.vars` is gitignored — never commit a real key.
#
# SECRETS ONLY. Anything non-secret belongs in wrangler.toml `[vars]`.
#
# Used by the `claude` personas (deepthought.svc, bluffer.svc). Leave it out and they log once and play
# the rules baseline, so the Worker runs end to end with no key at all.
#
# Deployed:  wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY --env faithnet
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
